    "Checks in order: EMPTY, TOO_LONG (> 30 code points), TOO_MANY_WORDS (> 3 space-separated words), INVALID_CHARS (outside letters/marks/space/'/’/./- plus ZWJ/ZWNJ, or no letter), MIXED_SCRIPT.",
    "normalized = display lower-cased with the English locale. Blocklist cases are deliberately NOT in this fixture (server-only)."
